# Mage: a worker with a staff from the Mage tower (StructureSystem::tickCarriers moves it and aims for it: no physics
# body, no unit sim, and nothing can hurt it). It turns a small cone of light on the nearest demon
# (StructureSystem::publishSearchlights). Global: the game writes its position. Spawned with its feet on the road.
# SHAPE (a placeholder; uniform scales): a blue robe (the root), a head, a stepped hat, and the STAFF it holds in
# FRONT of its body (-Z: an entity's forward is -Z) with a pale crystal ball on top.
# CullMode RootOnly: the root culls for all its pieces. Mover: the game moves it, so it is no shelter for the snow.
Prefab gameMage
	Global true
	Mover true
	CullMode RootOnly
	Component Render
		ObjectContainer baseshapes
		Node Pillar2
		Type StaticMesh
		Color 0.18 0.24 0.6
		Position 0 0.5 0
		Scale 0.24
